      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildCSS": "Additionally, follow these instructions even if they contradict the above ones above:\n- ONLY add styles to the `<style>` tag in the head of the document. Follow the pattern already in the index.html file.\n- Focus on the CSS tags emphasized in this level; do not add additional tags unless explicitly asked to.\n- Keep all explanations short, concise, and simple. Do not over-explain the changes you've made to the code.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button.",
        "documentation": "- Keep explanations simple and friendly\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button.",
        "explainCode": "- Keep explanations simple and friendly\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button."
