    "display_name": "Exploring Fonts",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Learn the rules for how to change the _font-family_ of text and load fonts from Google Fonts",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display&family=Source+Code+Pro&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n      h1 {\n        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n      }\n      li {\n        font-family: 'Source Code Pro', monospace;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Maya Chen</h1>\n    <h2>Summary</h2>\n    <p>A creative and detail-oriented student with experience in web design, writing, and community organizing.</p>\n\n    <h2>Skills</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>HTML and CSS</li>\n      <li>Graphic design</li>\n      <li>Public speaking</li>\n      <li>Team collaboration</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Experience</h2>\n    <h3>Student Council — Secretary</h3>\n    <p>Organized meetings, took notes, and helped coordinate school events for two years.</p>\n\n    <h3>School Newspaper — Staff Writer</h3>\n    <p>Wrote articles covering school news, student profiles, and community events.</p>\n\n    <h2>Education</h2>\n    <p>Currently enrolled at Westview High School, expected graduation 2026.</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>AP English Language</li>\n      <li>Web Design</li>\n      <li>Studio Art</li>\n    </ol>\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": true,
          "folderId": "0"
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1"
      ]
    },
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/5719963da0231456884c38b4a004790e-Screenshot 2025-04-02 at 7.42.24 AM.png",
    "name_suffix": "_pilot2",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "teacher_markdown": "**Intent:** Students are building a vocabulary of CSS properties so they can translate visual intuitions (\"I want it to feel warm\") into specific instructions (\"use a dark orange color for the headings\"). \r\n\r\n**Circulation questions:**\r\n\r\n- \"How would you describe what this property does in your own words?\"  \r\n- \"How does knowing this property change how you'd write a prompt for AI?\"\r\n\r\n**Expected mistakes and misconceptions:**\r\n\r\n- Students may apply styles randomly rather than intentionally \\- ask them \"why did you choose that color? What feeling were you going for?\"  \r\n- Students using Google Fonts may not know how to reference a font by name \\- the level instructions include a link to Google Fonts; encourage students to browse and pick one they like before prompting",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true"
  },
